         name = "Golden Beginner Course";
         noBlast = "1";
         partial = "0";
         startHelpText = "Careful not to fall; there are no checkpoints!";
         trivia = "Level created on December 10, 2021\nUpdates:\nMarch 8, 2026 - Added bounds and other OOB triggers.\nJuly 10, 2026 - Added challenge times, hints, and trivia.\nTrivia:\nIt\'s a rite of passage for some to make a course of all the MBG beginner levels sometime in their lifetime. This is where I did that. This is also the first level I refurbished with additional OOB triggers along with a normal bounds. The reason the last three interiors are so high up compared to the rest is because the pillars supporting Platform Party are so stupidly tall and I couldn\'t figure out how to move the interior any lower, since back then I didn\'t know about freecam.";
         type = "Custom";
         ultimateHint = "Skip little gaps at the start with edge hits and jumps, and try to use an optimal amount of super jumps in the stack at the end. You can also abuse the gyrocopters in platform party and into winding road.";
   };
